lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>YP 4.2 rc3 has passed QA and is =
pending TSC approval for release.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l3 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>YP 4.1.4 is now in =
QA.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l3 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Patches are merging into master =
for 4.3.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l3 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Emails to all currently listed =
maintainers have been sent to check the entries are up to date. If =
anyone is interested in taking on maintenance of any unassigned recipes, =
please send a patch.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l3 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We discovered warnings were not =
being correctly handled on the autobuilder after the buildbot controller =
upgrade. That should now be fixed but it means some regressions may have =
crept in, we&#8217;re working to confirm if that is the case or =
not.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l3 level1 =
lfo9;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We&#8217;re in the process of =
adding checks to ensure that ptests returning no test results trigger =
warnings. This should ensure we catch this situation earlier since =
ptests should always return at least one test result. =
python3-cryptography is an example of a recipe that recently regressed =
unnoticed in this way.<o:p></o:p></span></li></ul><p =
class=3DMsoNormal><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p><p style=3D'margin:0in'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;color:black'>Ways to =
contribute:</span><o:p></o:p></p><ul =
style=3D'margin-top:0in;padding-inline-start:48px' type=3Ddisc><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo10;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>As people are likely aware, the =
project has a number of components which are either unmaintained, or =
have people with little to no time trying to keep them alive. These =
components include: patchtest, layerindex, devtool, toaster, wic, oeqa, =
autobuilder, CROPs containers, pseudo and more. Many have open bugs. =
Help is welcome in trying to better look after these =
components!<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo10;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>There are bugs identified as =
possible for newcomers to the project: <a =
href=3D"https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Newcomers"><span =
style=3D'color:#1155CC'>https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Newcomers</spa=
n></a><o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo10;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>There are bugs that are =
currently unassigned for YP 4.3. See: <a =
href=3D"https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Bug_Triage#Medium.2B_4.3_Unass=
igned_Enhancements.2FBugs"><span =
style=3D'color:#1155CC'>https://wiki.yoctoproject.org/wiki/Bug_Triage#Med=
ium.2B_4.3_Unassigned_Enhancements.2FBugs</span></a><o:p></o:p></span></l=
i><li style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 =
level1 lfo10;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>We&#8217;d welcome new =
maintainers for recipes in OE-Core. Please see the list at: <a =
href=3D"http://git.yoctoproject.org/cgit.cgi/poky/tree/meta/conf/distro/i=
nclude/maintainers.inc"><span =
style=3D'color:#1155CC'>http://git.yoctoproject.org/cgit.cgi/poky/tree/me=
ta/conf/distro/include/maintainers.inc</span></a> and discuss with the =
existing maintainer, or ask on the OE-Core mailing list. We will likely =
move a chunk of these to &#8220;Unassigned&#8221; soon to help =
facilitate this.<o:p></o:p></span></li><li =
style=3D'color:black;margin-top:0in;margin-bottom:0in;mso-list:l1 level1 =
lfo10;vertical-align:baseline'><span =
style=3D'font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>Help is very much welcome in =
